Package: nocornacod
Type: Package
Title: Non-Coding RNA Conservation Prediction
Version: 0.0.11
Date: 2023-05-16
Author: Justin Lim
Maintainer: Justin Lim <justlim@mit.edu>
Description: An implementation of a pipeline to predict ncRNA associated with
    proteins using alignments of highly similar (>= 70% amino acid sequence
    identity) CDS. Predictions are made on the basis of RNA sequence
    conservation and RNA folding.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.2.3
SystemRequirements: R-scape, mafft, ViennaRNA
Suggests: tinytest
Depend: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    Biostrings (>= 2.62.0), 
    changepoint (>= 2.2.3),
    digest (>= 0.6.31),
    ggplot2 (>= 3.3.6),
    gggenes (>= 0.4.1),
    jsonlite (>= 1.8.2),
    IRanges (>= 2.32.0),
    methods,
    patchwork (>= 1.1.2),
    stats,
    svglite (>= 2.1.0),
    utils,
    xml2 (>= 1.3.0)
